  "description": "The first RL agent of David's track (issue #166, experiment 29) that beats its base bot. It plays greedy-full-probe-perf-r15 (Probe R) with the economy factor (type.build) times a per-turn level: x0.75 early, about x0.5 in turns 10-14 and x0.25-x0.5 from turn 15. Value iteration chose the levels over the state (turn, economy level), from 300,000 games with a random walk over the levels x0.25 to x1.5. rl-gate (Perfection, 10,000 seeds, Crazy, 3 opponents): +195 against Probe R, 58% of the differing seeds better, p = 1e-53. Trained for Perfection; after turn 29 (other modes) it keeps the last level, x0.25.",
